      <div type="clause" n="31.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 31.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ heonan forð we willað þæt abbodas ⁊ munecas regollicor libban þonne hi nu ær ðisan on gewunan hæfdon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And henceforth we desire abbots and monks to live more according to a rule that they have been accustomed to do until now.</ab>
      </div>
